AmbireAccountForkTest
├── when a mainnet account is built by the pinned factory
│   └── it should be supported and privilege only its signer key
├── when a sepolia account is built by the pinned factory
│   └── it should be supported and privilege only its signer key
├── when a mainnet batch call fails
│   └── it should revert execute with the call's own revert data
├── when a sepolia batch call fails
│   └── it should revert execute with the call's own revert data
├── when a mainnet privilege is written
│   └── it should emit Ambire's event layout
└── when a sepolia privilege is written
    └── it should emit Ambire's event layout
